1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Most adult friendships
don't end in a fight.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,500
They end in a
rescheduled coffee.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,500
“We should catch up soon”
→ six months of nothing.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:16,000
Nobody chose to end it. Nobody chose to continue it either.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Friendship is a default problem. Silence is the default. Contact is a choice.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,500
One message today
to someone drifting. No apology for the gap. Just hello.

7
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,000
Link in bio.
